                        "target_lang_word": "handbrake",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "handbrake",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b4473015-e32f-3282-b7bd-ca14566e48cb",
                                        "entry_id": "588a966d-5a1e-3dde-bc0b-f3b47c3858e6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A brake in a vehicle, set by hand, and usually locking on until released by hand, enabling its use when parked."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2054f21e-e50d-4fc5-9ec0-69457552f450",
                                                "sense_id": "b4473015-e32f-3282-b7bd-ca14566e48cb",
                                                "text": "On arrival at Spiez, the locomotive (No. 206) was immediately uncoupled and drew ahead to enable an Italian through coach from Interlaken to Milan to be loose shunted (with passengers aboard and controlled by means of its handbrake) on to the front of the train."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d04f0eb4-aaaa-3f24-ba5a-0cb254f56a7b",
                                        "entry_id": "588a966d-5a1e-3dde-bc0b-f3b47c3858e6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The mechanism, particularly the locking hand-operated lever or foot-operated toggle lever in a motorcar or the hand-operated crank on a railcar, which is used to set and release such a brake."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "handbrake",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f4a987b9-b4ce-3475-968f-56f3c97637e4",
                                        "entry_id": "c6dd0079-f879-31cf-8762-5c17e3af27b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To apply the handbrake in a vehicle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bf6bf152-483d-4391-b4b8-6a762fd7cadb",
                        "source_entry_id": "ffbeffac-2928-3c6c-9d4e-71b0a5a5f1ff",
                        "source_sense_id": "c22de59a-6d0d-3603-bb18-30b6b2d9528a",
                        "target_lang_word": "parking brake",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "parking brake",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1864f64-0640-369c-9c39-2fb74149236e",
                                        "entry_id": "097142a4-d455-3bcb-9ef1-294222c91c01",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A brake in a vehicle that can be set to avoid the vehicle rolling down a hill or being pushed away."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b16fbac4-f262-474a-b0fe-9ffc0e3d0ff3",
                                                "sense_id": "c1864f64-0640-369c-9c39-2fb74149236e",
                                                "text": "RSSB's report, released on September 23 2004, revealed that that the parking brakes on neither trolley had applied. It also revealed how the fixed piping carrying hydraulic pressure to the brake units on both had been severed and blanked off. This meant the parking brakes would not have been able to be released from the RRV. Washers to provide a clamping force to keep the parking brakes on were also missing, rendering them \"completely inoperative\"."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "70cca4db-37a9-4e6f-b749-4c335077e44d",
                        "source_entry_id": "ffbeffac-2928-3c6c-9d4e-71b0a5a5f1ff",
                        "source_sense_id": "c22de59a-6d0d-3603-bb18-30b6b2d9528a",
                        "target_lang_word": "frein à main",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "frein à main",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1650e73e-2521-3d20-a3df-07cebf56a582",
                                        "entry_id": "3c7e4ea9-a1cf-3912-a90b-bbd30637ce0d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Système de freinage agissant généralement sur les roues arrière d'une voiture, fonctionnant à l'aide d'un levier situé dans l'habitacle et servant à garantir l’immobilisation d’un véhicule à l’arrêt, ainsi que de freinage de secours en cas de panne des freins hydrauliques."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
